      "cues": [
        {
          "id": 1,
          "start": 2.08,
          "end": 3.27,
          "en": "So, let's now start",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 2,
          "start": 3.27,
          "end": 6.85,
          "en": "with the actual form submission in expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 3,
          "start": 6.85,
          "end": 9.95,
          "en": "where we did add this submitHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 4,
          "start": 9.95,
          "end": 13.863,
          "en": "Now, we are managing all the input states here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 5,
          "start": 14.7,
          "end": 17.27,
          "en": "So, when we talk about form submission,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 6,
          "start": 17.27,
          "end": 20.66,
          "en": "this primarily means that we wanna collect",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 7,
          "start": 20.66,
          "end": 23.93,
          "en": "all the entered values and maybe we also want",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 8,
          "start": 23.93,
          "end": 27.55,
          "en": "to validate them and show some feedback to the user.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 9,
          "start": 27.55,
          "end": 30.053,
          "en": "And that is something we will also do soon.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 10,
          "start": 30.96,
          "end": 31.793,
          "en": "For the moment,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 11,
          "start": 31.793,
          "end": 34.24,
          "en": "we'll start with collecting the entered values",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 12,
          "start": 34.24,
          "end": 37.97,
          "en": "and I will also start transforming some of the values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 13,
          "start": 37.97,
          "end": 39.58,
          "en": "To be precise, the amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 14,
          "start": 39.58,
          "end": 42.35,
          "en": "I wanna transform it from a string to a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 15,
          "start": 42.35,
          "end": 43.87,
          "en": "So here in submitHandler,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 16,
          "start": 43.87,
          "end": 47.49,
          "en": "we could add a expenseData object",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 17,
          "start": 47.49,
          "end": 48.57,
          "en": "where we in the end",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 18,
          "start": 48.57,
          "end": 51.18,
          "en": "just wanna have all the values entered here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 19,
          "start": 51.18,
          "end": 54.85,
          "en": "but we also might want to transform the values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 20,
          "start": 54.85,
          "end": 58.27,
          "en": "Therefore, I will re-add an amount property here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 21,
          "start": 58.27,
          "end": 62.55,
          "en": "and simply set this equal to plus, inputValues.amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 22,
          "start": 64.77,
          "end": 68.523,
          "en": "The plus here converts this string to a number.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 23,
          "start": 70,
          "end": 71.82,
          "en": "Now for the date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 24,
          "start": 71.82,
          "end": 76.15,
          "en": "I wanna convert this from text to an actual date object.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 25,
          "start": 76.15,
          "end": 80.58,
          "en": "So, actually we can create such a date object with new date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 26,
          "start": 80.58,
          "end": 85.58,
          "en": "and pass inputValues.date as a value to new date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 27,
          "start": 86.85,
          "end": 89.99,
          "en": "and they offer this string which represents a date",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 28,
          "start": 89.99,
          "end": 93.45,
          "en": "is passed as a value to the date constructor function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 29,
          "start": 93.45,
          "end": 98.45,
          "en": "And that indeed is working such that it is able to convert",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 30,
          "start": 98.52000000000001,
          "end": 101.18,
          "en": "date strings into date objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 31,
          "start": 101.18,
          "end": 103.67,
          "en": "If the string is formatted properly",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 32,
          "start": 103.67,
          "end": 105.82,
          "en": "which the string we are expecting here,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 33,
          "start": 105.82,
          "end": 108.03999999999999,
          "en": "which has this format will be.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 34,
          "start": 108.03999999999999,
          "end": 112.53,
          "en": "So, a date entered as text like this will be convertible",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 35,
          "start": 112.53,
          "end": 115.65299999999999,
          "en": "to a date object like this with JavaScript.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 36,
          "start": 116.89,
          "end": 117.99000000000001,
          "en": "Now for the description,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 37,
          "start": 117.99000000000001,
          "end": 121.33,
          "en": "I will just set this to inputValues.description",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 38,
          "start": 121.33,
          "end": 124.17,
          "en": "because I don't need to change this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 39,
          "start": 124.17,
          "end": 127.84,
          "en": "Now, we are not validating any user input here.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 40,
          "start": 127.84,
          "end": 131.91,
          "en": "We are not checking whether the state conversion worked",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 41,
          "start": 131.91,
          "end": 135.7,
          "en": "or if the user entered some incorrect values.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 42,
          "start": 135.7,
          "end": 138.98,
          "en": "We are not checking whether the amount is valid.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 43,
          "start": 138.98,
          "end": 140.38,
          "en": "We will do this later",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 44,
          "start": 140.38,
          "end": 143.46,
          "en": "but we are collecting the input values now.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 45,
          "start": 143.46,
          "end": 145.23,
          "en": "And now of course, in the end,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 46,
          "start": 145.23,
          "end": 150.2,
          "en": "we don't need the input values here in expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 47,
          "start": 150.2,
          "end": 152.53,
          "en": "but we need them in manage expense",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 48,
          "start": 152.53,
          "end": 155.22,
          "en": "where we have this confirmHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 49,
          "start": 155.22,
          "end": 159.063,
          "en": "where we are then triggering different context methods.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 50,
          "start": 160.01,
          "end": 164.22,
          "en": "Therefore, we can go back here to expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 51,
          "start": 164.22,
          "end": 166.11,
          "en": "and call onSubmit",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 52,
          "start": 167.05,
          "end": 169.07999999999998,
          "en": "which is that our prop we're getting,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 53,
          "start": 169.07999999999998,
          "end": 171.16,
          "en": "this onSubmit prop here",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 54,
          "start": 171.16,
          "end": 174.42000000000002,
          "en": "which should hold a value that is a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 55,
          "start": 174.42000000000002,
          "end": 178.06,
          "en": "that can be executed and that should be a function",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 56,
          "start": 178.06,
          "end": 181.24,
          "en": "that wants this expenseData which has this format.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 57,
          "start": 181.24,
          "end": 183.693,
          "en": "Amount, date and description as keys.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 58,
          "start": 185.02,
          "end": 186.47,
          "en": "And since we are the developer,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 59,
          "start": 186.47,
          "end": 189.64,
          "en": "we can make sure that onSubmit in expense form",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 60,
          "start": 189.64,
          "end": 191.563,
          "en": "receives such a function.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 61,
          "start": 192.46,
          "end": 195.9,
          "en": "In manage expense, we have confirmHandler",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 62,
          "start": 195.9,
          "end": 198.483,
          "en": "and here we could expect to get our expenseData.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 63,
          "start": 199.57,
          "end": 202.57999999999998,
          "en": "And then there, we could just forward expenseData",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 64,
          "start": 202.57999999999998,
          "end": 204.37,
          "en": "to our context functions",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 65,
          "start": 204.37,
          "end": 206.64,
          "en": "instead of setting our dummy objects.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 66,
          "start": 206.64,
          "end": 208.12,
          "en": "Because in those dummy objects,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 67,
          "start": 208.12,
          "end": 211.13,
          "en": "we had description, amount and date,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 68,
          "start": 211.13,
          "end": 213.48,
          "en": "and these are exactly the same fields",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 69,
          "start": 213.48,
          "end": 216.89,
          "en": "we have in our expenseData here just in a different order,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 70,
          "start": 216.89,
          "end": 218.62,
          "en": "but that doesn't matter.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 71,
          "start": 218.62,
          "end": 221.72,
          "en": "So therefore, if the expenseData is formatted like this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 72,
          "start": 221.72,
          "end": 224.32999999999998,
          "en": "we can pass that to our context",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 73,
          "start": 224.32999999999998,
          "end": 227.69,
          "en": "and we will therefore pass proper data to the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 74,
          "start": 227.69,
          "end": 230.653,
          "en": "Real user entered data to the context.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 75,
          "start": 231.52,
          "end": 235.82,
          "en": "Now we just have to connect confirmHandler to expense form.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 76,
          "start": 235.82,
          "end": 240.5,
          "en": "And we do that through the onSubmit prop",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 77,
          "start": 240.5,
          "end": 242.923,
          "en": "where we now point at confirmHandler.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 78,
          "start": 244.26,
          "end": 247.29,
          "en": "And with that, the validation is missing",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 79,
          "start": 247.29,
          "end": 251.76,
          "en": "but as long as we enter correct data, our app should work.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 80,
          "start": 251.76,
          "end": 255.59,
          "en": "If I now gift this a try, let's say here on iOS",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 81,
          "start": 256.67,
          "end": 261.67,
          "en": "and I enter 89.99 and I pick some date like date in June.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 82,
          "start": 263.98,
          "end": 265.733,
          "en": "This is a test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 83,
          "start": 266.69,
          "end": 268.26,
          "en": "We should be able to add this",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 84,
          "start": 268.26,
          "end": 270.94,
          "en": "and find this under all expenses.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 85,
          "start": 270.94,
          "end": 274.06,
          "en": "Here it is with the proper date, with the proper amount.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 86,
          "start": 274.06,
          "end": 276.06,
          "en": "And this is a test.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 87,
          "start": 276.06,
          "end": 279.67,
          "en": "And if I open this, I now of course can also edit this.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 88,
          "start": 279.67,
          "end": 282.64,
          "en": "Though we will soon make sure that these inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 89,
          "start": 282.64,
          "end": 285.54,
          "en": "are prefilled when we edit this,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 90,
          "start": 285.54,
          "end": 289.29,
          "en": "because at the moment we have to manually reenter everything",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 91,
          "start": 289.29,
          "end": 293.15,
          "en": "which is of course not a great user experience.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 92,
          "start": 293.15,
          "end": 295.11,
          "en": "But if I do update it,",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 93,
          "start": 295.11,
          "end": 299.46,
          "en": "indeed we see that it was updated with all the new data.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 94,
          "start": 299.46,
          "end": 302.53,
          "en": "So, that is generally working.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 95,
          "start": 302.53,
          "end": 305.44,
          "en": "Of course, we still wanna add some validation.",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 96,
          "start": 305.44,
          "end": 309.36,
          "en": "And we wanna make sure that we prefill those inputs",
          "zh": ""
        },
        {
          "id": 97,
          "start": 309.36,
          "end": 311.09,
          "en": "in case we are editing",
